{"verse": {"id": 2133029, "chapter_id": 3869, "verse_number": "३३", "content_sanskrit": "बाढमेवं करिष्यामि सर्वमेतद् भविष्यति\t॥३३॥", "padaccheda": "", "anvaya": "", "meaning_sanskrit": "", "meaning_english": "", "audio_url": null, "display_order": 39}, "commentaries": [{"id": 1, "verse_id": 2133029, "commentary_type": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "author": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "lang": "kn", "content": "ಶ್ರೀಭಗವಾನ್‌ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು. ಹಾಗೆಯೇ ಮಾಡುವೆನು. ನೀವು ಹೇಳಿದಂತೆಯೇ ಎಲ್ಲವೂ ಆಗುವುದು."}]}